WEBVTT

00:04:59.112 --> 00:05:01.288
per te krijuar lekure.

00:05:01.288 --> 00:05:03.482
Dhe, sot jam shume krenar t'ju tregoj,

00:05:03.482 --> 00:05:05.631
per here te pare,

00:05:05.631 --> 00:05:09.641
grumbullin e pare me lekure laboratori,

00:05:09.641 --> 00:05:11.204
e sapo dale prej tij.

00:05:11.204 --> 00:05:14.783
Kjo eshte nje lekure e vertete,

00:05:14.783 --> 00:05:18.306
por pa qene e nevojshme te sakrifikonim kafshe.

00:05:18.306 --> 00:05:21.484
Ka te gjitha karakteristikat e lekures

00:05:21.484 --> 00:05:24.969
sepse eshte prodhuar nga e njejta qelize,

00:05:24.969 --> 00:05:26.918
por me mire akoma,

00:05:26.918 --> 00:05:30.793
nuk ka qime per te shkulur,